WEBVTT

01:35.560 --> 01:38.280
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.360 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:48.200 --> 01:49.800
Legend has it

01:49.880 --> 01:52.520
that in order to learn
ancient mystique techniques,

01:52.600 --> 01:54.920
Dongfang Qingcang,
the Moon Supreme of the Moon Tribe,

01:55.000 --> 01:56.000
became a monster

01:56.080 --> 01:58.440
without any feelings.

02:00.800 --> 02:02.520
He killed his father,

02:02.600 --> 02:04.240
took the position of Moon Supreme,

02:04.720 --> 02:07.040
and led 100,000 soldiers of the Moon Tribe

02:07.120 --> 02:08.919
to burn, kill, and loot.

02:10.199 --> 02:13.360
The Fairy Realm Shuiyuntian,
the Moon Tribe Cangyan Sea,

02:13.440 --> 02:15.720
and the Mortal World Yunmeng Lake

02:15.800 --> 02:17.360
were in grave danger.

02:18.760 --> 02:20.480
In order to save the common people,

02:21.120 --> 02:22.600
Lady Chidi, God of War of Fairy Realm,

02:22.680 --> 02:24.400
even destroyed her primordial spirit

02:24.480 --> 02:27.160
to die with Dongfang Qingcang

02:27.240 --> 02:29.800
and sealed the 100,000 demon soldiers
of the Moon Tribe.

02:32.880 --> 02:34.880
But the primordial spirit
of Dongfang Qingcang

02:34.960 --> 02:36.680
cannot be destroyed.

02:36.760 --> 02:38.280
Once he is resurrected,

02:38.360 --> 02:42.200
the three realms will be in danger again.

02:45.560 --> 02:46.960
Legend has it

02:47.040 --> 02:48.760
that only the Goddess of Xishan

02:48.840 --> 02:51.560
can defuse this catastrophe.

02:51.640 --> 02:52.640
But she

02:53.520 --> 02:55.760
disappeared.

03:02.480 --> 03:08.440
YUJING, SHUIYUNTIAN

03:19.440 --> 03:23.800
ARBITER HALL, SHUIYUNTIAN

03:34.640 --> 03:39.800
FAIRY ORCHID

03:53.160 --> 03:54.360
I'm Orchid,

03:54.440 --> 03:55.760
a fairy.

03:57.040 --> 03:59.560
These are not ordinary leaves.

03:59.640 --> 04:00.760
They're Destiny Books.

04:01.600 --> 04:05.280
Every leaf tells the fate of a person.

04:12.080 --> 04:13.320
And my duty

04:13.400 --> 04:15.400
is to organize
and take care of these books.

04:15.960 --> 04:16.800
Don't worry.

04:16.880 --> 04:19.240
We won't interfere in anyone's fate.

04:22.600 --> 04:23.880
My master is Arbiter,

04:23.960 --> 04:26.160
a high immortal
in charge of the Destiny Book.

04:26.240 --> 04:27.440
She is not only my master

04:27.520 --> 04:29.320
but also my boss.

04:29.400 --> 04:30.560
Our relationship is like

04:30.640 --> 04:33.640
a shopkeeper
and shop assistant in the Mortal World.

04:33.720 --> 04:35.760
In front of misfortune,

04:36.240 --> 04:40.160
deities and humans

04:42.280 --> 04:44.720
can do nothing.

04:52.360 --> 04:55.440
We can do nothing.

04:56.320 --> 04:58.720
This unlucky orchid

04:58.800 --> 05:00.240
is me.

05:01.040 --> 05:03.040
Since she accidentally spoiled

05:03.120 --> 05:04.440
my immortal root with wine,

05:04.520 --> 05:07.240
my cultivation and power
have always been bad.

05:09.840 --> 05:11.640
After teaching me the skills,

05:11.720 --> 05:13.360
my master left for the Mortal World

05:13.440 --> 05:15.360
and hasn't come back for 500 years.

05:16.880 --> 05:17.920
Even though

05:18.000 --> 05:19.960
I'm a little lonely

05:20.040 --> 05:21.440
in Arbiter Hall alone,

05:21.520 --> 05:22.480
life

05:22.560 --> 05:24.040
isn't bad.

05:25.960 --> 05:27.920
I'm getting better
at repairing Destiny Books.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.640
I never burn the midnight oil.

05:30.480 --> 05:32.080
And there's not much to clean,

05:32.160 --> 05:33.640
so I'm not tired.

05:34.480 --> 05:36.200
The flowers have enlightened their wisdom,

05:36.280 --> 05:38.040
so they can chat with me.

05:39.200 --> 05:40.440
Don't sleep.

05:40.520 --> 05:42.040
Only by cultivating hard can you become

05:42.120 --> 05:43.320
a fairy like me soon.

05:44.040 --> 05:46.120
What time is it? Let me sleep more.

05:46.200 --> 05:48.440
What's so good about being like you?

05:48.520 --> 05:50.560
You do so much work.

05:50.640 --> 05:53.600
It's better to be a plant.

05:58.360 --> 05:59.800
The other fairies

05:59.880 --> 06:01.040
also treat me well.

06:01.120 --> 06:03.000
You even took the portrait
of Lord Changheng.

06:03.080 --> 06:04.640
You are so shameless.

06:04.720 --> 06:05.840
No one bullies me.

06:06.360 --> 06:08.880
Even we can't talk to Lord Changheng.

06:08.960 --> 06:11.360
Lord Changheng will
never look at you in this life.

06:14.840 --> 06:16.440
I plan to take the immortal examination

06:16.520 --> 06:17.720
and go to Fountain Palace

06:17.800 --> 06:19.480
to repay Lord Changheng.

06:20.000 --> 06:22.040
What is Orchid looking at?

06:22.120 --> 06:23.080
What else?

06:23.160 --> 06:24.880
Her Lord Changheng.

06:24.960 --> 06:27.240
That portrait is torn.
Why does she look at that all day?

06:27.320 --> 06:28.920
What does Lord Changheng look like?

06:29.000 --> 06:30.280
Why is Orchid so fascinated?

06:30.360 --> 06:32.080
He is the God of War, a bigwig.

06:32.160 --> 06:33.440
How can we see him?

06:33.520 --> 06:35.800
Then how exactly did Lord Changheng
become her savior?

06:35.880 --> 06:37.960
Could this be a dream of Orchid?

06:38.880 --> 06:40.560
Repairing Destiny Books is not hard

06:40.640 --> 06:41.640
but cumbersome.

06:41.720 --> 06:42.560
A man's fate

06:42.640 --> 06:44.840
can be affected by any minor things.

06:44.920 --> 06:46.920
A small discrepancy can make
a great difference.

06:47.000 --> 06:48.720
It's even more complicated

06:48.800 --> 06:50.640
in my master's words.

06:50.720 --> 06:52.520
One's destiny comes from natural law.

06:52.600 --> 06:54.800
- Everything is a circulation of karma.
- Karma in the past

06:54.880 --> 06:56.560
- Natural law and karma
- and everything now

06:56.640 --> 06:58.920
- will never be depleted.
- will result in the future.

06:59.800 --> 07:01.800
I can repair 50 books a day,

07:01.880 --> 07:03.320
1,500 each month.

07:03.400 --> 07:04.560
After I repair 50,000 of them,

07:04.640 --> 07:06.880
I'll write a letter of resignation
to Master.

07:06.960 --> 07:07.920
By then,

07:08.000 --> 07:09.800
Lord Changheng, my savior,

07:09.880 --> 07:11.240
should be back.

07:23.600 --> 07:28.960
YUNZHONG WATER PAVILION, SHUIYUNTIAN

07:31.760 --> 07:32.600
Lord Yunzhong.

07:52.360 --> 07:54.880
GOD OF WAR, CHANGHENG

07:56.360 --> 07:59.520
SHUIYUNTIAN EMPEROR, LORD YUNZHONG

08:04.320 --> 08:05.360
Changheng.

08:06.240 --> 08:09.040
You regained lost ground
in the Northernmost Ocean

08:09.600 --> 08:11.880
and defeated Xunfeng,
the leader of the Moon Tribe.

08:11.960 --> 08:13.440
You helped pacify the rebellion.

08:15.080 --> 08:16.720
What reward do you want?

08:16.800 --> 08:18.680
The Moon Tribe was already divided.

08:18.760 --> 08:20.240
They were just a disorderly mob.

08:20.320 --> 08:22.080
It's my duty to quell the rebellion.

08:22.160 --> 08:23.080
I dare not take credit.

08:23.160 --> 08:25.840
Lord Changheng is too modest.

08:25.920 --> 08:26.760
Yes.

08:27.520 --> 08:28.920
Although Xunfeng

08:29.000 --> 08:30.960
is far weaker
than the deceased Dongfang Qingcang,

08:31.440 --> 08:34.000
he is the top threat to Shuiyuntian now.

08:34.080 --> 08:35.640
Lord Changheng seriously hurt

08:35.720 --> 08:37.960
Xunfeng's vitality this time.

08:38.039 --> 08:39.360
His contribution is immeasurable.

08:39.440 --> 08:41.440
Even if Dongfang Qingcang
were still alive,

08:41.520 --> 08:44.240
I would kill him too.

08:45.280 --> 08:46.240
However,

08:46.320 --> 08:47.680
as the Northernmost Ocean
just settled down,

08:47.760 --> 08:50.200
there are still many affairs to do.

08:50.280 --> 08:51.520
I wonder

08:51.600 --> 08:53.520
why you recalled me back to Yujing.

08:56.120 --> 09:01.080
HAOTIAN TOWER, SHUIYUNTIAN

09:36.160 --> 09:37.520
Trepidation from Haotian Tower?

09:38.200 --> 09:41.040
Do you still remember Dongfang Qingcang?

09:41.120 --> 09:41.960
Of course.

09:42.040 --> 09:43.040
Thirty thousand years ago,

09:43.120 --> 09:44.760
Dongfang Qingcang was killed by immortals.

09:44.840 --> 09:46.520
But what does he have to do
with Haotian Tower?

09:46.600 --> 09:47.840
You were young at that time,

09:47.920 --> 09:49.080
so you're not aware.

09:49.160 --> 09:51.960
Although immortals got together
to kill him,

09:52.040 --> 09:54.640
his body was still preserved
and his primordial spirit was intact.

09:54.720 --> 09:56.920
My father could only
secretly seal him in Haotian Tower

09:57.000 --> 09:59.400
with the help of the immortals.

09:59.880 --> 10:01.840
To avoid panic in Shuiyuntian,

10:01.920 --> 10:05.760
this became a secret
that only a few high immortals knew.

10:06.840 --> 10:07.720
That day,

10:07.800 --> 10:09.840
Lord Dong trapped his soul and body

10:09.920 --> 10:10.960
and led immortals

10:11.040 --> 10:13.240
to set thousands of seals
in Haotian Tower.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.600
It was called Haotian Matrix.

10:15.080 --> 10:16.880
This matrix has gathered
all the immortals' power.

10:16.960 --> 10:19.560
In terms of strength,
no one in the three realms can destroy it.

10:19.640 --> 10:21.280
Then why is there trepidation
with Haotian Tower?

10:21.360 --> 10:23.080
Although Dongfang Qingcang

10:23.160 --> 10:24.640
is unconscious,

10:24.720 --> 10:26.320
his primordial spirit is still powerful.

10:26.880 --> 10:28.320
It pounded every day

10:28.400 --> 10:30.440
and actually loosened the seal.

10:30.520 --> 10:33.840
If his primordial spirit
goes out of the tower,

10:33.920 --> 10:35.880
the three realms will be in danger.

10:35.960 --> 10:37.320
My father is still in seclusion.

10:37.400 --> 10:39.200
So I called you back

10:39.280 --> 10:41.800
to strengthen the seal
with the help of all high immortals.

10:43.480 --> 10:44.520
Yes.

10:48.640 --> 10:53.320
ARBITER HALL, SHUIYUNTIAN

10:53.880 --> 10:58.280
This is the 42,699th.

10:59.400 --> 11:00.320
I'm almost there.

11:05.240 --> 11:06.400
I'm coming.

11:10.040 --> 11:13.040
ARBITER HALL

11:14.040 --> 11:15.720
As a peach blossom spirit,
you do nothing all day.

11:15.800 --> 11:17.440
Does it take that long to answer the door?

11:18.000 --> 11:19.480
I'm not a peach blossom.

11:19.560 --> 11:21.040
I am an orchid.

11:21.120 --> 11:23.120
And I have things to do.

11:23.200 --> 11:25.720
High Immortal Buyusi
wants to check the Destiny Books.

11:26.520 --> 11:27.720
Hurry up.

11:33.120 --> 11:35.440
LIANG SHENG, DU RUO,
LIANG XUE, AN GE, CHUAN MING

12:00.680 --> 12:01.920
What an unlucky day.

12:02.960 --> 12:04.960
Lord Changheng returns victoriously today

12:05.040 --> 12:06.600
and we're not able to welcome him.

12:06.680 --> 12:10.320
We're sent to such a remote place instead
to get Destiny Books.

12:12.320 --> 12:14.360
These are the Destiny Books you want.

12:15.320 --> 12:16.240
Wait.

12:16.800 --> 12:17.840
Excuse me.

12:17.920 --> 12:19.320
Did you say

12:19.400 --> 12:22.280
that Lord Changheng is back?

12:22.360 --> 12:23.560
Why are you asking about that?

12:23.640 --> 12:25.960
You're a Bengal rose
with a damaged immortal root.

12:26.040 --> 12:27.080
Do your chores.

12:27.160 --> 12:28.280
Don't ask nonsense.

12:30.440 --> 12:31.320
Let's go.

12:35.440 --> 12:36.440
They always act this way.

12:36.520 --> 12:37.800
If Master were here,

12:37.880 --> 12:39.160
you wouldn't dare to be this way.

12:40.360 --> 12:47.200
ARBITER HALL

12:50.600 --> 12:52.240
This is great!

12:52.320 --> 12:53.960
Lord Changheng is back early.

12:54.040 --> 12:56.160
I'm going to pick
a basket of the most beautiful flowers

12:56.240 --> 12:57.600
and bring them to Fountain Palace.

12:59.160 --> 13:00.080
Orchid.

13:00.160 --> 13:02.240
Does Lord Changheng remember who you are?

13:02.320 --> 13:03.800
That's why I should dress up

13:03.880 --> 13:05.800
and give Lord Changheng a good impression.

13:10.600 --> 13:15.520
SHUYU FOREST, SHUIYUNTIAN

13:27.720 --> 13:29.080
Lord Changheng.

13:29.160 --> 13:31.040
Orchid. Be graceful.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.320
Bear what I told you in mind.

13:32.400 --> 13:34.240
You should appear gentle,

13:34.320 --> 13:35.720
enchanting, and gorgeous.

13:35.800 --> 13:37.320
Only then will he remember you.

14:32.600 --> 14:33.800
Thank…

14:33.880 --> 14:36.360
Thank you, Lord Changheng.

14:39.000 --> 14:40.160
Wait.

14:49.880 --> 14:50.920
These flowers

14:51.840 --> 14:52.760
are for you.

14:55.720 --> 14:57.000
There's no need.

14:57.080 --> 14:58.360
It's my duty to kill the enemy.

14:59.720 --> 15:02.480
These are not for your victorious return.

15:06.200 --> 15:08.000
One thousand five hundred years ago,

15:08.080 --> 15:11.160
I was just an orchid in Arbiter Hall.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.520
My master, Arbiter,

15:12.600 --> 15:14.680
accidentally destroyed my immortal root,

15:15.240 --> 15:17.920
so she didn't want to keep me.

15:19.000 --> 15:20.200
Coincidentally,

15:20.280 --> 15:23.520
you came to the Arbiter Hall

15:23.600 --> 15:25.520
and persuaded my master to keep me,

15:25.600 --> 15:27.360
saying maybe I can survive.

15:27.440 --> 15:30.520
That's why I could cultivate my wisdom

15:30.600 --> 15:32.000
and transform into human form.

15:34.040 --> 15:34.960
So?

15:35.520 --> 15:36.560
So…

15:37.280 --> 15:39.480
So I want to tell you in person…

15:39.560 --> 15:40.640
No. So…

15:41.680 --> 15:43.320
So Lord Changheng,

15:43.400 --> 15:45.080
you're my savior.

15:45.800 --> 15:48.320
I've always wanted to thank you in person.

15:49.160 --> 15:50.080
These flowers

15:50.640 --> 15:51.800
are for you.

15:53.600 --> 15:54.520
There's no need.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.600
I don't remember

15:58.160 --> 15:59.160
what you said.

16:00.120 --> 16:01.080
You don't remember?

16:08.800 --> 16:11.160
I'm sorry to bother you, Lord Changheng.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.120
Wait.

16:40.920 --> 16:42.920
Lord Changheng, your Spirit Jade.

16:45.520 --> 16:47.160
You've already scared the fireflies away.

16:47.240 --> 16:48.240
The Magical Firefly Stone

16:48.320 --> 16:50.600
is just an ordinary stone.

16:50.680 --> 16:51.840
It's useless to keep it.

16:53.040 --> 16:54.120
Get rid of it for me.

17:00.840 --> 17:02.080
You mean

17:03.400 --> 17:04.839
you're giving it to me?

17:05.480 --> 17:07.319
Not only did he give me a Spirit Jade,

17:07.400 --> 17:08.800
but he also accepted my flower.

17:09.680 --> 17:11.440
There were so many flowers,

17:11.520 --> 17:13.839
but he just chose a little orchid.

17:14.920 --> 17:17.880
Is this destiny?

17:24.079 --> 17:25.200
What is this?

17:29.480 --> 17:30.720
Lord Changheng!

17:31.720 --> 17:33.280
I'll surely pass the immortal examination.

17:33.360 --> 17:35.560
I will definitely enter
the Fountain Palace!

17:48.480 --> 17:51.160
YUJING, SHUIYUNTIAN

17:53.240 --> 17:55.080
IMMORTAL EXAMINATION PARTICIPANTS

18:02.680 --> 18:05.120
As long as we can pass
the immortal examination,

18:05.200 --> 18:07.040
we can serve Lord Changheng
in Fountain Palace.

18:07.120 --> 18:08.400
We'll get the highest wage,

18:08.480 --> 18:09.960
progress in rank rapidly,

18:10.040 --> 18:12.160
and even see Lord Changheng often.

18:12.240 --> 18:13.160
Yes. Right.

18:18.200 --> 18:20.440
It's okay. There's a next time.

18:23.760 --> 18:25.280
Isn't she a flower spirit?

18:25.360 --> 18:26.560
Why is she here?

18:26.640 --> 18:27.480
Exactly.

18:28.040 --> 18:29.760
- Why is she here?
- Exactly.

18:29.840 --> 18:30.800
How did she come in?

18:32.080 --> 18:33.160
- How can she be here?
- Right.

18:33.240 --> 18:34.800
- What good is she?
- Right.

18:34.880 --> 18:36.240
- She was chosen, I'm telling you…
- All right.

18:46.240 --> 18:53.240
ARBITER HALL, ORCHID

18:57.680 --> 19:01.600
- Why is she here?
- If she can pass, we'll all pass.

19:01.680 --> 19:03.600
The lowest plant spirit

19:03.680 --> 19:05.120
even wants to enter Fountain Palace?

19:05.200 --> 19:06.640
- Exactly.
- How delusional.

19:06.720 --> 19:07.680
I'm not that.

19:08.880 --> 19:09.960
I remember her.

19:10.040 --> 19:12.360
She's a peony by the gate of Arbiter Hall.

19:12.440 --> 19:14.320
- No. She's a Bengal rose.
- Why is a peony here?

19:14.400 --> 19:16.040
- What?
- I remember she's a peony.

19:16.120 --> 19:18.120
- Is she a peony?
- Why is a little spirit here?

19:18.800 --> 19:20.640
Even she can be here.

19:20.720 --> 19:22.000
I'm neither a peony

19:22.080 --> 19:22.920
nor a Bengal rose.

19:23.520 --> 19:25.560
I am Orchid from Arbiter Hall.

19:27.160 --> 19:28.720
All of you

19:28.800 --> 19:30.600
had better remember
my name and background.

19:31.240 --> 19:32.640
Because I will defeat all of you

19:32.720 --> 19:34.200
in the immortal examination.

19:36.680 --> 19:37.520
This…

19:37.600 --> 19:40.000
- What a joke.
- Indeed.

19:42.320 --> 19:44.320
- Look.
- What flower is she?

19:45.720 --> 19:47.280
- Defeat us?
- Orchid.

19:48.280 --> 19:49.560
What a joke!

19:51.440 --> 19:53.160
How could they laugh at you?

19:53.240 --> 19:54.320
Isn't it just the immortal examination?

19:54.400 --> 19:56.240
If you fail, they may fail too.

19:56.320 --> 19:59.120
Exactly. Whatever they've said,
you should just forget it.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.720
We're all with you.

20:01.280 --> 20:02.840
With friends like you,

20:02.920 --> 20:03.840
it's worth it.

20:06.000 --> 20:07.480
To be honest,

20:07.560 --> 20:08.560
I do need

20:08.640 --> 20:10.600
your support now.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.720
As you all know,

20:12.280 --> 20:14.040
my immortal root is damaged.

20:14.120 --> 20:15.400
To pass the exam,

20:15.480 --> 20:17.480
I have to cure it.

20:17.560 --> 20:18.840
But elixirs

20:18.920 --> 20:20.600
really cost a lot.

20:21.600 --> 20:25.440
If you have any extra money,

20:25.520 --> 20:26.680
can you…

20:28.760 --> 20:30.280
PLANT SPIRIT, CREEPER
PLANT SPIRIT, PEACH

20:30.360 --> 20:31.600
Peach.

20:35.200 --> 20:36.480
Orchid,

20:36.560 --> 20:37.640
in the past 1,000 years,

20:37.720 --> 20:39.360
you've taken so many elixirs

20:39.920 --> 20:41.880
and spent all your salary on that.

20:41.960 --> 20:44.560
I think you'd better save your money.

20:47.520 --> 20:48.440
PLANT SPIRIT, SUCCULENT

20:48.520 --> 20:49.600
Yes. Exactly.

20:50.960 --> 20:52.840
That's not what you said earlier.

20:52.920 --> 20:54.560
I must repay Lord Changheng
for his kindness.

20:54.640 --> 20:56.800
That has always been my dream.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.680
For what?

20:58.760 --> 21:00.040
You just like him.

21:02.920 --> 21:05.040
We didn't want to expose your lie.

21:05.120 --> 21:06.880
But you can't lie to yourself.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.640
No matter how much you like him,

21:08.720 --> 21:09.760
he won't like you.

21:13.120 --> 21:14.240
Why?

21:15.240 --> 21:17.440
You should know who your competitor is.

21:18.880 --> 21:19.720
Danyin,

21:19.800 --> 21:21.720
the most beautiful girl in Shuiyuntian.

21:21.800 --> 21:23.880
Her father is Supreme Liyuan.

21:23.960 --> 21:24.920
Who's your father?

21:26.040 --> 21:27.000
Who?

21:27.080 --> 21:28.240
Orchid.

21:28.320 --> 21:29.280
You are a little flower.

21:29.360 --> 21:30.800
You don't have a father.

21:31.600 --> 21:33.440
What does this have to do with that?

21:43.240 --> 21:44.120
Look.

21:45.280 --> 21:47.480
This is called Magical Firefly Stone.

21:47.560 --> 21:48.960
I've looked it up.

21:49.040 --> 21:50.760
It is a rare jade.

21:51.360 --> 21:52.880
In the cold Northernmost Ocean,

21:52.960 --> 21:54.720
it takes 10,000 years for one to form.

21:54.800 --> 21:56.360
It's extremely precious.

21:56.440 --> 21:58.800
But Lord Changheng gave this to me.

21:59.480 --> 22:01.080
Isn't this just a lame stone?

22:01.640 --> 22:03.560
Maybe he was just tired of it
and didn't want it anymore.

22:05.000 --> 22:06.040
Look.

22:06.120 --> 22:07.400
The fireflies in it are all gone.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.040
It's worthless.

22:10.160 --> 22:11.440
Orchid.

22:11.520 --> 22:12.640
We should accept our fates.

22:13.200 --> 22:14.560
Stop dreaming. Just forget it.

22:14.640 --> 22:16.360
Yes.

22:16.440 --> 22:17.920
Enough!

22:18.680 --> 22:20.920
Is what you're all saying
really for her sake?

22:21.640 --> 22:23.520
Are you really Orchid's friends?

22:23.600 --> 22:26.840
Friends should stand with her
at critical moments, shouldn't they?

22:27.880 --> 22:30.040
Orchid, the spirit stones I've saved

22:30.120 --> 22:31.240
are all in the garden.

22:31.320 --> 22:32.760
I was going to buy some medicine

22:32.840 --> 22:34.080
after transforming.

22:34.160 --> 22:35.560
But now,

22:35.640 --> 22:36.560
you can take them all.

22:38.720 --> 22:41.840
Creeper, thank you.

22:43.480 --> 22:44.560
By the way,

22:44.640 --> 22:46.480
their private stashes

22:46.560 --> 22:47.640
are there too.

22:53.920 --> 22:55.640
Creeper, you wench!

22:55.720 --> 22:57.360
- Orchid!
- No!

22:58.280 --> 23:00.200
- Don't take mine.
- That's mine!

23:01.680 --> 23:03.400
No words can express my thanks.

23:03.480 --> 23:04.960
After I pass the immortal examination

23:05.040 --> 23:06.120
and become an immortal maid,

23:06.200 --> 23:08.280
my salary will be your salary!

23:11.080 --> 23:11.920
This is great.

23:12.000 --> 23:14.040
With these spirit stones,
I can buy elixirs.

23:22.360 --> 23:24.040
That is Lord Changheng's Destiny Book.

23:32.120 --> 23:34.640
How strange. The destiny
of a high immortal is very stable.

23:34.720 --> 23:36.040
Why would it change?

24:00.360 --> 24:02.360
Why did it break?

24:03.320 --> 24:04.160
This is bad.

24:04.240 --> 24:06.640
Lord Changheng's body and spirit
might be destroyed tonight.

24:10.200 --> 24:12.520
HAOTIAN TOWER, SHUIYUNTIAN

24:12.600 --> 24:13.720
It's time.

24:13.800 --> 24:15.000
Immortals.

24:15.720 --> 24:17.400
We have to strengthen the seal

24:17.480 --> 24:19.120
within 15 minutes.

24:19.200 --> 24:20.600
No mistake is allowed.

24:20.680 --> 24:21.800
- Yes.
- Yes.

24:47.480 --> 24:48.800
I've always been doing good deeds

24:49.440 --> 24:50.920
and didn't do anything evil.

24:51.000 --> 24:52.760
I don't wish to be rich or lucky.

24:52.840 --> 24:55.560
I only hope I can fix my immortal root
and have a peaceful life.

24:55.640 --> 24:58.240
My spirit won't dissipate today, right?

25:05.640 --> 25:06.640
It's okay.

25:06.720 --> 25:08.960
With so many high immortals,

25:09.040 --> 25:11.160
Lord Changheng will surely be fine.

25:58.760 --> 26:01.200
The lifeline of Lord Changheng
is still broken.

26:09.400 --> 26:11.680
This looks exactly the same
as what I saw in the Destiny Book.

26:12.360 --> 26:13.280
What should I do?

26:13.360 --> 26:14.680
It's almost midnight.

26:14.760 --> 26:16.720
My dear disciple, remember this.

26:16.800 --> 26:18.200
The master of Destiny Books

26:18.680 --> 26:21.120
can neither say anything to its owner

26:21.200 --> 26:23.760
nor change anyone's fate.

26:23.840 --> 26:26.560
Otherwise, he will bear
the wrath of the heavens

26:27.360 --> 26:29.080
and his spirit will dissipate.

26:43.000 --> 26:43.880
Changheng!

27:21.600 --> 27:22.480
Lord Yunzhong.

27:23.000 --> 27:24.800
A fairy has fallen into Haotian Tower.

27:24.880 --> 27:26.600
The seal of Haotian Tower
has been completed.

27:27.320 --> 27:28.280
We can't open it again.

27:47.160 --> 27:49.280
Help!

30:41.680 --> 30:46.160
DONGFANG QINGCANG'S SEA OF EMOTIONS

31:42.600 --> 31:43.520
Who is she?

31:45.480 --> 31:47.280
Why is she wearing my dress?

32:19.960 --> 32:20.960
A ghost!

32:22.000 --> 32:23.280
Help!

32:23.360 --> 32:24.440
Help!

32:24.520 --> 32:26.200
Help me.

32:26.280 --> 32:27.160
Let go of me.

32:28.360 --> 32:29.720
Help.

32:30.560 --> 32:32.000
Shut up.

32:47.600 --> 32:51.120
Why do you look like me?

32:53.880 --> 32:55.560
I don't know

32:55.640 --> 32:57.080
why I have switched bodies with you.

32:59.480 --> 33:01.000
You mean

33:04.720 --> 33:06.840
you are now in my body

33:09.200 --> 33:11.040
and I'm in yours?

33:21.280 --> 33:22.560
Then what should we do?

33:51.520 --> 33:53.200
Do you see the Haotian Matrix?

33:53.280 --> 33:55.080
That is the exit.

33:55.160 --> 33:57.320
As you are in my body,

33:57.400 --> 33:58.880
you now have mighty power.

33:58.960 --> 34:01.480
As long as you destroy the matrix
with your power,

34:01.560 --> 34:03.480
we can break the seal and escape.

34:04.360 --> 34:05.600
After we go out,

34:06.120 --> 34:07.760
we can naturally switch our bodies back.

34:08.800 --> 34:11.440
The Haotian Matrix?

34:13.719 --> 34:14.880
Wait.

34:14.960 --> 34:17.120
You are a criminal who was sealed.

34:17.199 --> 34:19.000
You want to trick me into letting you out.

34:25.639 --> 34:27.639
You'd better not mention me

34:27.719 --> 34:30.120
in the same breath as those losers.

34:30.679 --> 34:32.080
My patience is limited.

34:32.679 --> 34:35.360
Destroy the Haotian Matrix now.

34:35.440 --> 34:36.360
Otherwise,

34:37.080 --> 34:39.080
I'll kill you now.
